<div class="frame" style="width: 380px; height: 1060px;">
  <div class="apphead" style="padding: 0 16px; gap: 10px;">
    <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.2px;">Advantage</span>
    <span style="flex-grow: 1;"></span>
    <span style="display: block; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--ink-100);"></span>
  </div>
  <div style="flex-grow: 1; display: flex; min-height: 0; background: var(--surface-muted);">
    <div class="rail" style="flex: 0 0 300px; background: var(--surface-card); gap: 16px;">
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Match</span>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
          <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;">M. Ellison</span>
          <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--viz-good)" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>
          <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-500);">vs</span>
          <span style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-600);">R. Duval</span>
        </div>
        <span class="score" style="font-size: 22px;">6&ndash;4 3&ndash;6 7&ndash;5</span>
        <!-- Four fact rows collapse to one wrapped line, paying for the space
             the shape below needs -->
        <span class="micro tabular" style="line-height: 1.65;">Mar 14, 2026 &middot; Hard &middot; <span class="mono">02:14:38</span> &middot; 247 points &middot; 31 games</span>
      </div>

      <div style="height: 1px; background: var(--border-hairline);"></div>

      <!-- What the space buys: the shape of the match, in the rail, on every tab -->
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Serve placement</span>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 260 150" width="260" height="150" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect x="4" y="4" width="252" height="142" fill="none" stroke="var(--ink-300)" stroke-width="1"></rect>
          <line x1="4" y1="75" x2="256" y2="75" stroke="var(--ink-200)" stroke-width="1"></line>
          <line x1="130" y1="4" x2="130" y2="146" stroke="var(--ink-200)" stroke-width="1"></line>
          <circle cx="110" cy="38" r="14" fill="var(--blue)" opacity="0.45"></circle>
          <circle cx="120" cy="54" r="10" fill="var(--blue)" opacity="0.3"></circle>
          <circle cx="150" cy="44" r="9" fill="var(--blue)" opacity="0.26"></circle>
          <circle cx="216" cy="50" r="7" fill="var(--ink-400)" opacity="0.55"></circle>
          <circle cx="34" cy="110" r="7" fill="var(--ink-400)" opacity="0.5"></circle>
          <circle cx="142" cy="112" r="9" fill="var(--blue)" opacity="0.26"></circle>
        </svg>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px;">
          <span class="micro">Deuce T</span>
          <span style="flex-grow: 1;"></span>
          <span class="tabular" style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--blue);">77%</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--surface-subtle); padding: 11px 12px;">
        <span class="eyebrow-sm">Match data</span>
        <span class="bar" style="width: 100%;"></span>
        <span class="bar" style="width: 86%;"></span>
        <span class="bar" style="width: 54%;"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="cap">
    <h3>Rail 4 &mdash; Compact, with a shape</h3>
    <p>Compresses the facts into one wrapped meta line and spends what it saves on a serve-placement thumbnail that stays put on every tab. The rail stops being a caption and starts carrying a finding of its own.</p>
    <p class="trade">A second home for something Shots &amp; placement owns, and it has nothing to show on a match with no placement data.</p>
  </div>
</div>
